# Budget Plan Generator

A budget and debt payoff calculator that runs entirely in the browser.

## Host on GitHub Pages (easiest)
1. Create a new GitHub repo and upload `index.html`.
2. Settings > Pages > Source: "Deploy from a branch", branch `main`, folder `/ (root)`.
3. Your tool goes live at `https://YOUR-USERNAME.github.io/REPO-NAME/`.

## Host on Streamlit Community Cloud
1. Upload `app.py`, `index.html` and `requirements.txt` to a GitHub repo.
2. Go to share.streamlit.io, click "New app", pick the repo, and set the main file to `app.py`.
